{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/Rodgers20/NBA_Player_Stats_Predictor/pull/1","repo":"Rodgers20/NBA_Player_Stats_Predictor","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"claude-code-open","title":"fix: combo props never surfaced due to median-based line producing ~50% hit rate","body":"The combo prop line was set at `math.floor(median) + 0.5`. For integer stats\n(PTS, REB, AST are always whole numbers), the median of 10 values equals the\naverage of the 5th and 6th sorted values, and floor(median)+0.5 lands exactly\nat the boundary — guaranteeing ~50% hit rate by definition. The 55% filter\ntherefore blocked every single combo prop, making the feature produce nothing.\n\nFix: use the same value-line methodology as individual stat props — set the\ncombo line at 92% of the L10 average (same `floor(avg * 0.92 / 0.5) * 0.5`\nformula used for PTS/REB/AST/etc.). This places the line below typical output\nso genuine over-performers register 60–80% hit rates and pass the filter.\n\nAlso adds a safe `consistency_mult = 1.0` default before the stat-type loop\nso combo props don't risk a NameError when no individual stat qualified.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01XTHS1GFwGAHEBBJWdSDH44","authorType":"User","additions":1912,"deletions":76,"changedFiles":34,"files":[{"path":"Makefile","additions":38,"deletions":0},{"path":"api/__init__.py","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"api/main.py","additions":71,"deletions":0},{"path":"api/requirements.txt","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"path":"api/routes/__init__.py","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"api/routes/games.py","additions":84,"deletions":0},{"path":"api/routes/players.py","additions":118,"deletions":0},{"path":"api/routes/props.py","additions":96,"deletions":0},{"path":"dashboard/app.py","additions":70,"deletions":73},{"path":"frontend/.env.local.example","additions":4,"deletions":0},{"path":"frontend/.gitignore","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"frontend/app/analysis/page.tsx","additions":212,"deletions":0},{"path":"f